            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Shipyard 1.0.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Shipyard now checks for updates on its own, once a day. When a new version is out you'll get a prompt to install it, and you can always check yourself from <b>Check for Updates…</b> in the menu or in Settings.</li>
  <li>Updates are signed, so Shipyard only installs versions that really come from its developer.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
